{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12884","headline":"送襄垣王君归南阳别墅 · 韩翃","name":"送襄垣王君归南阳别墅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"都门霁後不飞尘，草色萋萋满路春。\n双兔坡东千室吏，三鸦水上一归人。\n愁眠客舍衣香满，走渡河桥马汗新。\n少妇比来多远望，应知蟢子上罗巾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩翃","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12884.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12884","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}